# Scene checks

- Run `TheDayBefore.EditModeTests` before saying a weapon, house, collider, texture, or prop change works. The tests live in `Assets/Tests/EditMode/SceneRulesTests.cs`.
- A knife trace starts inside the player capsule. Use `PlayerWeapons.TryPick`. Do not raycast from the eyes and take the first hit.
- One solid floor: `GreyboxWorld.BuildWalkSurface`. Road, dashes, glass, and lamps are not colliders.
- House walls overlap at the corners. Floor and ceiling close the room. Every window has a pane.
- Box texture scale is the face size / 1.4 m. Ground and road scales are world size / tile.
- Do not `FitHeight` a flat mesh (rug, fern card) up to metres.
- Lamp bounds must not intersect benches or tables. Lamps spawn with `collider: false`.
- Do not leave a script that teleports the player or enters Play by itself.
- Official Asset Store free packs and CC0 only. No getasset.net, no unityhub.pro.
- A second Unity while `Temp/UnityLockfile` exists will exit. Do not start one.

The longer list of failures is in the personal skill `playable-scene`.
